### Close an existing work order
POST http://localhost:3000/workshop/work-orders/2/close
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ltqbkdaMvxKR50RKQzJPehDhf_aQIRHnd9mq3PaeHHE

